@startuml
title Вариант 1 — основной сценарий: push подтверждён
autonumber
hide footbox
participant "Бизнес-сервис" as B
participant "API" as A
database "PostgreSQL" as D
participant "Relay" as R
queue "Kafka critical" as K
participant "Coordinator" as C
participant "Push worker" as W
participant "APNs/FCM" as P
participant "Клиент" as U
participant "Receipt Gateway" as G
B -> A: событие + business_key
A -> D: TX: unique notification + outbox
D --> A: synchronous commit (t0)
A --> B: 202 + notification_id
R -> D: прочитать outbox
R -> K: NotificationAccepted, key=user_id
K -> C: событие (at-least-once)
note right of C: Контакты получены от сервиса настроек.
C -> D: Одна TX: inbox dedup + policy snapshot\n+ attempt PREPARED + timer + command outbox
R -> K: SendAttempt(attempt_id)
K -> W: команда
W -> D: Gate: confirmed/closed/TTL/допуски;\nCAS PREPARED -> DISPATCHING + lease
D --> W: право отправки, epoch
W -> P: push(notification_id), stable attempt key
P --> W: accepted (не DELIVERED)
W -> D: attempt ACCEPTED
P -> U: push
U -> G: authenticated delivery ACK
G -> D: TX: receipt + confirmed gate + outbox
G --> U: ACK сохранён
R -> K: ReceiptConfirmed
K -> C: ReceiptConfirmed
C -> D: TX: DELIVERED; отменить pending timers/commands
note over C,D: Поздние повторы receipt не меняют терминальный результат.
@enduml
